# API call for register a user

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"ammu",
    "email":"ammu@gmail.com",
    "password":"pass123",
    "password2":"pass123",
    "phone_number":"5432900500",
    "address":"kochi street ,apartment 24",
    "blood_group":"O-",
    "city":"kochi",
    "account_type":"public"
}

# API call for user login

###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"ammu",
    "password":"pass123"
}

